-jinshu-057","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-057-appraisal-ws2413329"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-appraisal:p002","text":"贊曰：憲居玉疊，才博流譽。修赴石門，惠政攸著。孝興、玄威，操履無違。愚墳畢禮，楊門致譏。璜謀超絕，彥材雄傑。潛師襲董，觀兵歎薛。惟趙與張，神略多方。作尉北地，立功西湘。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":100,"last_line":100,"raw_start":8348,"raw_end":8432,"raw_character_offsets":[8348,8349,8350,8351,8352,8353,8354,8355,8356,8357,8358,8359,8360,8361,8362,8363,8364,8365,8366,8367,8368,8369,8370,8371,8372,8373,8374,8375,8376,8377,8378,8379,8380,8381,8382,8383,8384,8385,8386,8387,8388,8389,8390,8391,8392,8393,8394,8395,8396,8397,8398,8399,8400,8401,8402,8403,8404,8405,8406,8407,8408,8409,8410,8411,8412,8413,8414,8415,8416,8417,8418,8419,8420,8421,8422,8423,8424,8425,8426,8427,8428,8429,8430,8431],"revision_id":2413329},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-057-appraisal:p002:m0003","surface":"憲","start":3,"end":4,"person_id":"q05_0zd_hux","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-appraisal:p002:m0013","surface":"修","start":13,"end":14,"person_id":"8zw_lx6_9le","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-appraisal:p002:m0023","surface":"孝興","start":23,"end":25,"person_id":"5d6_771_0f2","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-appraisal:p002:m0026","surface":"玄威","start":26,"end":28,"person_id":"z0n_1jd_fda","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-appraisal:p002:m0044","surface":"璜","start":44,"end":45,"person_id":"kjg_7m2_c09","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-appraisal:p002:m0049","surface":"彥","start":49,"end":50,"person_id":"zv2_5nr_ili","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-appraisal:p002:m0057","surface":"董","start":57,"end":58,"person_id":"34k_uqq_jlg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-appraisal:p002:m0062","surface":"薛","start":62,"end":63,"person_id":"kpq_tg0_zwl","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-057-appraisal","book_id":"b-jinshu-057","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-057-appraisal-ws2413329"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang:p002","text":"璜有謀策，周窮好施，能得人心。滕修數討南賊，不能制，璜曰：「南岸仰吾鹽鐵，斷勿與市，皆壞為田器。如此二年，可一戰而滅也。」修從之，果破賊。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":50,"last_line":50,"raw_start":3955,"raw_end":4024,"raw_character_offsets":[3955,3956,3957,3958,3959,3960,3961,3962,3963,3964,3965,3966,3967,3968,3969,3970,3971,3972,3973,3974,3975,3976,3977,3978,3979,3980,3981,3982,3983,3984,3985,3986,3987,3988,3989,3990,3991,3992,3993,3994,3995,3996,3997,3998,3999,4000,4001,4002,4003,4004,4005,4006,4007,4008,4009,4010,4011,4012,4013,4014,4015,4016,4017,4018,4019,4020,4021,4022,4023],"revision_id":2413329},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang:p002:m0000","surface":"璜","start":0,"end":1,"person_id":"kjg_7m2_c09","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang:p002:m0015","surface":"滕修","start":15,"end":17,"person_id":"8zw_lx6_9le","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang:p002:m0026","surface":"璜","start":26,"end":27,"person_id":"kjg_7m2_c09","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang:p002:m0061","surface":"修","start":61,"end":62,"person_id":"8zw_lx6_9le","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-057-tao-huang","book_id":"b-jinshu-057","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-057-tao-huang-ws2413329"},{"id":"c-jinshu-057-teng-xiu:p001","text":"滕修，字顯先，南陽西鄂人也。仕吳為將帥，封西鄂侯。孫皓時，代熊睦為廣州刺史，甚有威惠。徵為執金吾。廣州部曲督郭馬等為亂，皓以修宿有威惠，為嶺表所伏，以為使持節、都督廣州軍事、鎮南將軍、廣州牧以討之。未克而王師伐吳，修率眾赴難。至巴丘而皓已降，乃縞素流涕而還，與廣州刺史閭豐、蒼梧太守王毅各送印綬，詔以修為安南將軍，廣州牧、持節、都督如故，封武當侯，加鼓吹，委以南方事。修在南積年，為邊夷所附。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":21,"last_line":21,"raw_start":1122,"raw_end":1318,"raw_ch